{
  "_format_version": 1,
  "_loader_notes": [
    "Cardio sessions (AGENTS.md W2). Each session is one cardio block; intervals are the timed segments the cardio player steps through (seconds add up to duration_minutes).",
    "effort is 1 to 10 'how hard it should feel' (effort_scale below). settings_guidance gives ranges to aim for; machines vary, so copy says 'about' and 'aim for'.",
    "Progression: add minutes first up to max_minutes, then intensity, as written in 'progression' (shown to her in plain English).",
    "Beginners get steady and finisher sessions only for their first 4 weeks (beginner_ok=false for intervals).",
    "machine_id 'mixed' means each segment names its machine in settings.machine_id. If a machine is taken, any cardio machine can be swapped in at the same effort.",
    "Sessions of 10 minutes or more count towards the weekly target and streak. Cardio never counts towards strength PBs.",
    "Calories and distance are never estimated by the app; she can type distance herself.",
    "Draft for coach review before launch."
  ],
  "effort_scale": {
    "1": "Barely moving",
    "2": "Very easy",
    "3": "Easy, like a stroll",
    "4": "Comfortable, you can chat easily",
